  <h1>First Call Maintenance - SMS Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p>Last updated: August 30, 2026</p>

  <p>First Call Maintenance ("FCM," "we," "us") operates a text messaging
  service that allows tenants to submit maintenance requests and receive
  status updates about those requests.</p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <p>When you text our maintenance number, we collect your phone number
  and the content of your message in order to log, respond to, and
  track your maintenance request.</p>

  <h2>How we use your information</h2>
  <p>Your phone number and message content are used solely to process
  your maintenance request, communicate updates about that request to
  you, and maintain a record of the request for our internal property
  management operations.</p>

  <h2>No sharing of mobile information</h2>
  <p>We do not share, sell, or rent your mobile phone number or SMS
  opt-in data to third parties or affiliates for their own marketing or
  promotional purposes. Your information is used only for the purpose
  of operating this maintenance request service.</p>

  <h2>Message frequency</h2>
  <p>Message frequency varies based on your maintenance request activity.
  You will generally receive a confirmation message when a request is
  received, and status update messages as that request is scheduled,
  worked on, and completed.</p>

  <h2>Message and data rates</h2>
  <p>Message and data rates may apply, depending on your mobile carrier
  and plan.</p>

  <h2>Opting out</h2>
  <p>Reply STOP at any time to opt out of receiving text messages from
  this number. Reply HELP for assistance.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about this policy can be directed to First Call
  Maintenance through your normal property contact channels.</p>
